{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日になりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私生駒里奈はAKB48チームBとして劇場デビューしましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兼任が決まってから二ヶ月くらい経つのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場公演に出るという事で、レッスンやリハに参加して、覚える事、やる事が沢山あって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"徐々に心の何処かに不安が積もってきて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チームBの皆とレッスンしていくうちに仲良くなって、分からないことも教えてくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みおちゃんも同じ兼任仲間だし、まーちゅんは移籍して、このチームはいろんな所から集って出来たチームだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎのぎの皆もいっぱい助けてくれた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフさんにも沢山お世話になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の支えがあって初日を迎えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKBのファンの皆さんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ようこそっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と声をかけて下さいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっとしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点とか、いろいろあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書きたいこととかいっぱいあってうまく整頓出来ないけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は沢山学んでいきたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから大丈夫っっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんっっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"劇場は特殊な場所でした〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも踊る事楽しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆさんとユニットでこの曲をやりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/04/29/5841227/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てもでもの涙"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/04/29/5841227/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まゆゆさんの表現力に圧倒されました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もあんな風になりたいっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと衣装のスカート丈は短いな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/04/29/5841227/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ますます燃えてきたぜ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルも頑張るぞっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"ty